### Models
Defines database tables using SQLAlchemy ORM classes. Each class represents a physical table in your SQLite database.
Remember to use VALID HTTP ERROR CODES!

## Expected Files
``user.py``     - User
``hotel.py``    - Hotel & Room
``booking.py``  - Booking & Ticket

